## plaintext-bearer-guard.ts / plaintext_bearer_guard.py

Ported from
[`rohitg00/agentmemory`](https://github.com/rohitg00/agentmemory)
(commit `f0e0d0e`+), specifically from
`integrations/openclaw/plugin.mjs` functions:

- `usesPlaintextBearerAuth(baseUrl, secret)` → `uses_plaintext_bearer_auth`
- `plaintextBearerAuthMessage(baseUrl)` → `plaintext_bearer_auth_message`
- `createPlaintextBearerAuthGuard({ warn, env })` → `create_plaintext_bearer_auth_guard` (TS) / `check_plaintext_bearer` (Python)

